    {
      "id": "s01-method-flow",
      "intent": "The recurrence returns to the thought stage, while the dense carrier stays in the end-to-end image flow.",
      "claim": "A persistent dense carrier, read and updated by a compact thought process.",
      "narration": "The image first becomes a dense field, so spatial detail has somewhere to live. The loop is local to the DQ-CTM thought process, not the whole image pipeline. The same DQ-CTM parameters are reused across ticks before the decoder produces the output.",
